WEBVTT

00:37.620 --> 00:41.958
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE

01:22.457 --> 01:23.958
It's always the same pattern.

01:24.834 --> 01:28.171
I'm overcome with hunger
after extreme blood loss or exhaustion.

01:32.842 --> 01:34.469
- I need to feed.
- I need to feed.

01:36.971 --> 01:38.807
- I need to feed.
- I need to feed.

01:42.560 --> 01:45.271
- I need to feed.
- I need to feed.

01:48.608 --> 01:50.652
- I need to feed.
- I need to feed.

02:12.090 --> 02:13.216
This is bad.

03:22.285 --> 03:25.580
You will only experience good luck
from now on.

04:22.136 --> 04:25.473
BUGANG COMPANY
VICE PRESIDENT JANG HO-JAE

04:29.310 --> 04:33.189
CALL ME

04:48.246 --> 04:49.914
BUGANG COMPANY

05:16.858 --> 05:20.403
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN MEMORY AND OBLIVION

05:20.486 --> 05:24.407
EPISODE 3
PIECES OF MEMORIES

05:25.491 --> 05:30.246
BUGANG COMPANY

05:42.675 --> 05:43.593
Have a seat.

05:56.147 --> 05:59.984
Do you want something to drink?
Coffee? Or something else?

06:01.778 --> 06:02.779
Let's talk first.

06:06.407 --> 06:07.992
Let's do introductions first.

06:10.578 --> 06:12.205
I already told you my name.

06:12.288 --> 06:13.498
What's yours?

06:15.666 --> 06:16.584
I don't have one.

06:17.210 --> 06:20.129
We're on the same side,
but you won't even tell me your name?

06:20.213 --> 06:21.714
Since we're on the same side,

06:22.715 --> 06:24.133
we can skip the trivialities.

06:29.055 --> 06:29.889
How's your injury?

06:32.475 --> 06:33.309
Are you all right?

06:35.561 --> 06:38.940
You were seriously hurt that day.

06:44.028 --> 06:45.780
I'd like to set just two rules.

06:47.407 --> 06:48.991
No personal questions.

06:50.493 --> 06:51.953
And you do as I say.

06:54.831 --> 06:57.083
No introductions and no catching up?

06:57.166 --> 06:59.043
You're one unfriendly teammate.

06:59.127 --> 07:01.629
I'm going to call Madam Na's phone now.

07:02.338 --> 07:03.423
But Madam Na's dead.

07:04.090 --> 07:06.092
The person who killed her has her phone.

07:07.343 --> 07:08.803
He was also the last person

07:10.054 --> 07:10.888
to request a job.

07:15.309 --> 07:16.727
What was the job?

07:31.868 --> 07:32.827
Look familiar?

08:02.732 --> 08:03.649
What are you doing?

08:04.859 --> 08:07.361
You're on probation. Don't wander around.

08:07.445 --> 08:08.446
Give me a break.

08:09.447 --> 08:11.782
Do you mean to lock me up
until I'm a living corpse?

08:11.866 --> 08:15.953
If that's the only way
to control a variable like you, yes.

08:19.499 --> 08:20.708
What are you so afraid of?

08:24.587 --> 08:27.256
That's why you keep trying
to suppress and control us.

08:29.634 --> 08:30.635
You're scared

08:31.636 --> 08:32.803
that we'll be a threat.

08:34.013 --> 08:36.265
Is that why Ho-jae
had to go through surgery?

08:37.558 --> 08:38.684
He got on my nerves.

08:41.062 --> 08:42.605
He was getting in the way.

08:47.109 --> 08:48.194
He was annoying.

08:49.028 --> 08:49.862
That's why.

08:52.907 --> 08:55.159
Do you really think you can control us?

08:55.243 --> 08:59.830
I do know how to control
the Najin inside your head.

09:03.709 --> 09:05.211
Go back to your room.

09:08.589 --> 09:11.133
Actually, I met one of our kind outside.

09:21.477 --> 09:22.353
SILVERBILL

09:22.436 --> 09:23.312
It's her.

09:29.068 --> 09:29.902
Hello?

09:30.570 --> 09:31.737
Are you looking for me?

09:33.489 --> 09:34.740
Do you know me?

09:35.366 --> 09:36.242
How?

09:37.451 --> 09:38.869
Is she with you?

09:42.290 --> 09:43.207
Amazing.

09:44.750 --> 09:48.546
So she's alive after all that.
She really must be one of my kind.

09:49.922 --> 09:51.424
What are you talking about?

09:52.091 --> 09:53.718
I'm sure you know what I mean.

09:53.801 --> 09:56.762
I don't. That's why I asked.
So spell it out.

09:56.846 --> 09:57.888
What did you mean?

09:59.849 --> 10:00.975
Answer me.

10:19.285 --> 10:21.495
- Who was that?
- Ho-jae.

10:23.372 --> 10:25.249
He's with her right now.

10:26.459 --> 10:28.044
What do we do? Call him again?

10:30.212 --> 10:31.047
Let's wait.

10:33.049 --> 10:33.966
Hey.

10:34.884 --> 10:37.511
He said that you were "one of his kind."

10:37.595 --> 10:39.680
Do you know what he meant by that?

10:42.933 --> 10:45.811
You're one of us.

10:47.313 --> 10:48.397
No.

10:55.154 --> 10:57.198
MADAM NA
LET US MEET TONIGHT

10:57.281 --> 10:58.282
It's him.

10:59.450 --> 11:00.326
He wants to meet.

11:08.334 --> 11:10.336
CHOOSE A LOCATION

11:15.383 --> 11:16.217
Done.

11:16.967 --> 11:18.302
That's all I needed from you.

11:18.386 --> 11:19.512
"That's all"?

11:20.179 --> 11:21.263
I'll be going alone.

11:21.931 --> 11:22.973
Are you kidding me?

11:23.724 --> 11:26.060
Didn't I just help you set up the meeting?

11:26.143 --> 11:27.061
Look.

11:27.144 --> 11:29.397
I'm the one being framed as a suspect.

11:29.480 --> 11:31.357
I'm the one he wants to meet.

11:31.440 --> 11:34.276
There are some things
you should never encounter in your life.

11:36.237 --> 11:39.490
Get involved with them, and in a flash,
your life will become hell.

11:41.659 --> 11:43.035
You can't revert that…

11:45.705 --> 11:46.956
or return to the past.

11:49.041 --> 11:52.670
You may have to live your whole life
like you're in an endless nightmare.

11:54.463 --> 11:56.590
Are you threatening me
or worrying about me?

11:56.674 --> 11:58.551
I'm seriously trying to dissuade you.

12:00.678 --> 12:02.221
You can't handle that guy.

12:02.304 --> 12:03.764
Then call the police.

12:03.848 --> 12:06.851
My goal is to catch him,
not to escalate the situation.

12:08.310 --> 12:11.188
What if we call the police
and he decides to hide away?

12:13.190 --> 12:14.650
Then it'd be a lost cause.

12:14.734 --> 12:16.902
He's looking for me.

12:16.986 --> 12:19.905
He wants to meet me, not you.

12:19.989 --> 12:22.783
Recklessness isn't the same
as bravery, you know.

12:22.867 --> 12:26.996
I'd rather die before I let anyone
walk into danger by themselves.

12:29.665 --> 12:31.292
You said we're on the same side.

12:32.126 --> 12:33.043
So we go together.

12:37.631 --> 12:39.508
Are they going to meet up?

12:39.592 --> 12:43.012
Yes, they will make contact
with the suspect who has Madam Na's phone.

12:43.095 --> 12:44.054
Time and place?

12:44.138 --> 12:47.349
Not confirmed yet.
I'm planning on tailing them.

12:47.433 --> 12:51.395
I'll request backup.
Follow them when they're on the move.

12:51.479 --> 12:55.566
Wait, what are you gonna do?
Who did you say you're meeting?

12:55.649 --> 12:57.401
The guy who killed the Owl Bar owner.

12:57.485 --> 13:00.154
She thinks
he's behind the motel murder too.

13:00.237 --> 13:03.157
Then call the cops.
You shouldn't be going there!

13:03.240 --> 13:06.243
If we call the cops and he finds out,
he'll go deeper into hiding,

13:06.327 --> 13:07.578
and it'll be a lost cause.

13:08.078 --> 13:09.288
Says who?

13:09.371 --> 13:10.247
She does.

13:10.956 --> 13:13.542
And you trust her?
How many times have you met her?

13:13.626 --> 13:15.294
Not sure. Maybe twice?

13:16.504 --> 13:17.379
Hey.

13:18.255 --> 13:20.382
Do you even know what her name is?

13:20.466 --> 13:22.259
- Ms. Silverbill?
- What does she do?

13:22.343 --> 13:24.136
She finds missing people.

13:24.220 --> 13:25.971
I knew it!

13:26.055 --> 13:28.724
Everything about her
is vague, uncertain, and unclear.

13:28.808 --> 13:31.435
But you're going to follow her blindly
without question?

13:31.519 --> 13:32.436
This isn't like you.

13:33.354 --> 13:34.438
I know.

13:34.522 --> 13:37.107
But strangely, I find myself believing
whatever she says.

13:38.484 --> 13:40.611
Because you've fallen for her looks!

13:40.694 --> 13:42.071
Snap out of it, man!

13:42.154 --> 13:44.907
What are you gonna do
if she turns out to be an accomplice?

13:44.990 --> 13:47.117
What if they're playing you?

13:47.201 --> 13:49.703
Her closest friend was murdered.

13:49.787 --> 13:51.747
Yong-gil, put yourself in her shoes.

13:51.831 --> 13:55.334
If someone murdered me so violently,
wouldn't you lose your mind?

13:55.417 --> 13:57.753
Wait, why are you making this about us?

13:58.337 --> 13:59.421
I feel very offended.

13:59.505 --> 14:01.549
Would you lose your mind or not?

14:01.632 --> 14:02.925
I'd lose it, man!

14:03.008 --> 14:04.927
Would you look for the culprit like crazy?

14:05.010 --> 14:06.387
Yeah, I so would!

14:06.470 --> 14:08.848
- Will you be our backup later?
- Yeah, I will--

14:08.931 --> 14:09.849
Thanks, man.

14:12.142 --> 14:13.811
You crazy son of a… Damn you!

14:15.020 --> 14:16.397
Make sure you dress warmly.

14:19.567 --> 14:20.442
Hold on.

14:21.694 --> 14:22.820
It's three times.

14:23.779 --> 14:25.531
I've seen her three times already.

14:48.596 --> 14:49.722
Is that you, Jong-hyeok?

14:49.805 --> 14:51.640
Yes, Grandma. I'm home.

14:53.976 --> 14:55.895
Goodness. You must be tired.

14:55.978 --> 14:58.230
- I'm fine.
- Well done today.

15:12.995 --> 15:13.996
Go wash your hands.

15:14.079 --> 15:15.497
- Let's eat first.
- Okay.

15:17.082 --> 15:19.126
So, your training starts tomorrow?

15:19.209 --> 15:21.253
Yeah, it goes on for a month.

15:21.879 --> 15:24.089
What kind of training takes a full month?

15:24.173 --> 15:26.175
I heard all new employees go through it.

15:28.135 --> 15:29.303
Grandma, what's this?

15:29.970 --> 15:31.013
What?

15:33.474 --> 15:36.143
What else? It's a new suit.

15:36.894 --> 15:38.395
I received a bonus!

15:38.479 --> 15:40.272
Really? From Madam Na?

15:40.356 --> 15:42.775
No, from Master Jang.

15:42.858 --> 15:45.194
Master… who?

15:45.277 --> 15:46.528
Don't worry about it.

15:46.612 --> 15:48.530
Have a seat. Let's eat.

15:48.614 --> 15:49.490
Okay.

16:00.626 --> 16:01.752
You cooked so much food!

16:01.835 --> 16:03.837
AHN JONG-HYEOK, MULTI-SUPPORT TEAM
JEONSEUNG BIOTECH

16:03.921 --> 16:06.423
You won't be having home-cooked meals
for a while now, that's why.

17:05.983 --> 17:06.817
Ho-jae.

17:07.860 --> 17:09.737
I'm telling you one more time--

17:09.820 --> 17:11.030
I'll be back.

17:21.832 --> 17:22.666
Scared?

17:24.209 --> 17:26.045
No. Not at all.

17:31.216 --> 17:32.760
Someone's got fancy gadgets.

17:32.843 --> 17:34.136
It's two-way.

17:36.847 --> 17:37.681
And these.

17:40.142 --> 17:42.728
If things look bad,
throw them hard on the ground.

17:43.812 --> 17:45.230
They'll go off on their own.

17:47.816 --> 17:49.735
Where did you get equipment like this?

17:50.402 --> 17:54.490
Are you a retired soldier?
A former NIS agent or something?

17:55.449 --> 17:57.659
They're effective
for two to three minutes each,

17:58.160 --> 18:02.039
so you'll buy enough time to get back
to the car if you use them in intervals.

18:03.582 --> 18:05.084
Again with the mixed messages.

18:05.793 --> 18:07.878
Are you worrying about me
or threatening me?

18:09.129 --> 18:11.256
I'm saying let's not slow each other down.

18:36.115 --> 18:38.534
Why do you keep your name a secret anyway?

18:39.535 --> 18:42.121
Do you have a hang-up about your name?

18:43.622 --> 18:47.042
Or do you carry a secret
that you can't divulge?

18:52.589 --> 18:53.423
Ms. Silverbill.

18:55.092 --> 18:56.093
Can you hear me?

18:56.593 --> 18:57.427
Hello?

18:57.928 --> 18:59.429
- Mic check--
- Focus, will you?

19:04.309 --> 19:06.270
Okay. Roger that.

19:19.908 --> 19:23.120
I guess he's already here.
Moving toward R2.

21:01.843 --> 21:03.095
Ms. Silverbill,

21:03.178 --> 21:04.304
are you on your way?

21:05.639 --> 21:06.682
Where are you?

21:08.350 --> 21:09.351
Ms. Silverbill.

21:34.668 --> 21:35.585
What was that?

21:38.171 --> 21:39.923
I think we walked into a trap.

21:40.424 --> 21:41.842
You need to run away.

21:44.303 --> 21:45.387
Now!

22:19.254 --> 22:21.131
Where are you now? Are you okay?

22:24.634 --> 22:25.927
I'm on my way. Keep running!

22:52.079 --> 22:53.038
Hold on a sec.

22:55.374 --> 22:57.167
Jang Ho-jae, you idiot.

23:37.999 --> 23:39.209
This way!

23:52.722 --> 23:55.142
What are those things? Are they human?

23:55.225 --> 23:56.685
Let's get out of here first.

24:10.073 --> 24:11.408
This is my fight from now on.

24:12.868 --> 24:13.910
What does that mean?

24:13.994 --> 24:16.455
If you're here, I can't fight properly.

24:16.538 --> 24:17.372
What?

24:21.668 --> 24:22.627
I'm sorry.

25:28.151 --> 25:29.569
And who the heck are you?

25:30.362 --> 25:31.238
Hi.

25:33.031 --> 25:33.865
Ho-jae.

25:35.659 --> 25:36.993
It's been so long.

25:37.577 --> 25:38.453
No, wait.

25:39.538 --> 25:40.872
We met briefly last time.

25:43.416 --> 25:44.751
When I stabbed that woman.

27:14.924 --> 27:16.635
Are you the one called Silverbill?

27:16.718 --> 27:19.220
Tell me who you are
before you ask questions.

27:20.347 --> 27:21.765
What the hell are you bastards?

27:25.101 --> 27:27.145
Are you with the guy who killed Madam Na?

28:12.941 --> 28:14.234
You bastard.

28:14.317 --> 28:15.610
Were you that scared?

28:16.444 --> 28:18.947
What was that swarm of people
that I just saw?

28:19.030 --> 28:20.323
I heard you had surgery.

28:22.659 --> 28:24.077
I just came to check

28:25.662 --> 28:27.664
if all your memories really disappeared…

28:29.666 --> 28:32.502
and if there really is nothing left.

29:16.880 --> 29:18.214
Fucking assholes.

29:19.674 --> 29:21.342
This isn't what we agreed.

30:10.683 --> 30:12.477
Man, that was boring.

30:13.853 --> 30:15.188
Is that all you got?

30:17.982 --> 30:18.900
Keep going.

30:21.861 --> 30:24.197
Keep going, you asshole.

31:06.906 --> 31:08.575
Those who came here today

31:10.243 --> 31:11.411
are all gonna die.

31:17.709 --> 31:19.961
No. Don't do it.

31:20.044 --> 31:20.962
Don't, you bastard!

31:21.045 --> 31:22.297
Master Jang.

31:39.981 --> 31:40.857
No…

31:51.451 --> 31:52.785
Are you all right?

31:55.330 --> 31:56.497
Master Jang.

31:57.707 --> 31:58.833
No.

31:59.626 --> 32:00.501
Stay with me.

32:01.961 --> 32:02.837
No!

32:03.463 --> 32:04.464
End them now.

32:05.340 --> 32:06.883
You have to get up. No.

32:08.217 --> 32:10.178
No, please. Wake up!

32:19.771 --> 32:21.689
Ho-jae, get in quickly!

32:41.960 --> 32:42.794
After them!

32:42.877 --> 32:43.711
Forget it.

32:46.089 --> 32:47.090
There's no need.

32:51.636 --> 32:52.804
They'll soon find out…

32:54.931 --> 32:56.474
what it is that they rescued.

33:10.238 --> 33:11.406
Is she dead?

33:11.489 --> 33:13.241
Tell me! Is the woman dead?

33:13.825 --> 33:15.451
God, this is messed up!

33:15.535 --> 33:17.578
- What's going on?
- Let's go to the hospital.

33:17.662 --> 33:19.163
- What? The hospital?
- Step on it.

33:19.247 --> 33:21.332
- Floor it!
- The hospital? Just wait.

33:25.753 --> 33:26.587
What?

33:27.755 --> 33:28.756
What's happening?

33:29.632 --> 33:30.466
Are you all right?

33:32.010 --> 33:35.513
She hasn't fully recovered
from the injury two days ago.

33:35.596 --> 33:37.181
I need to feed.

33:37.265 --> 33:40.435
Add to that more enormous blood loss
due to the exact same injury.

33:40.935 --> 33:44.772
It'd be near impossible for her
to resist the hunger and thirst.

33:47.275 --> 33:48.276
I need to feed.

33:48.359 --> 33:49.694
I need to feed.

33:52.989 --> 33:55.491
You're losing a lot of blood.
We have to stem it first.

33:57.702 --> 34:00.038
Stop the car!

34:00.621 --> 34:02.582
- Stop the car!
- What are you doing?

34:02.665 --> 34:04.417
- Stop!
- Are you out of your mind?

34:04.500 --> 34:05.960
- Let me go!
- Don't do this!

34:28.608 --> 34:30.234
Yong-gil.

34:31.986 --> 34:33.946
Yong-gil, are you okay?

34:35.073 --> 34:36.240
Yong-gil, wake up.

34:53.466 --> 34:54.759
I need to feed.

34:54.842 --> 34:56.844
- I need to feed.
- I need to feed.

34:56.928 --> 34:59.263
I need to feed.

35:00.556 --> 35:03.142
- I need to feed.
- I need to feed.

35:04.727 --> 35:05.603
This is bad.

35:05.686 --> 35:06.729
Ms. Silverbill!

35:11.317 --> 35:13.277
I need to feed.

35:13.861 --> 35:14.904
- What's wrong?
- I need--

35:14.987 --> 35:15.947
Get away from me!

35:20.034 --> 35:21.452
I'm sorry.

35:28.376 --> 35:30.795
Get away from me.

35:32.004 --> 35:33.381
Don't come close.

35:36.843 --> 35:38.469
You have to go to the hospital.

35:38.553 --> 35:39.804
You might actually die!

35:39.887 --> 35:41.139
Before I do!

35:43.057 --> 35:44.475
Before I do…

35:47.353 --> 35:48.855
I might end up killing you.

35:50.898 --> 35:55.319
I might end up attacking you, so please…

35:58.114 --> 36:01.242
please just go.

36:01.868 --> 36:02.702
Please…

36:10.168 --> 36:12.128
I don't know why I'm acting like this.

36:13.296 --> 36:14.172
But…

36:15.882 --> 36:17.675
a name came to me just now.

36:19.510 --> 36:20.678
Ms. Yoon Chae-ok.
